{"meta":{"id":"ajax-get-post","category":"it/syntax/jquery/ajax","title":"$.ajax get · post · jQuery","subtitle":"(JQUERY · AJAX)","summary":"url · type · data · success · error, 여러 값 전송, res.split 으로 문자열 응답 나누기","tags":["jquery","f-network","f-async"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>JQUERY · AJAX</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">$.ajax get · post · jQuery</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> url · type · data · success · error, 여러 값 전송, res.split 으로 문자열 응답 나누기</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">get</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">$.ajax({\r\n  url: &quot;${ctp}/member/idCheck&quot;,\r\n  type: &quot;get&quot;,\r\n  data: { mid: mid, name: name },    // 여러 값은 콤마로\r\n  success: function (res) {          // 전송 성공 시 서버 응답\r\n    $(&quot;#demo&quot;).html(res);\r\n  },\r\n  error: function () {\r\n    alert(&quot;전송 오류~~&quot;);\r\n  }\r\n});</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">post · 문자열 응답 나누기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let query = { mid: mid };\r\n\r\n$.ajax({\r\n  url: &quot;${ctp}/ajaxTest3&quot;,\r\n  type: &quot;post&quot;,\r\n  data: query,\r\n  success: function (res) {          // 서버가 &quot;kim/홍길동/100/3&quot; 처럼 / 로 이어 보낸 경우\r\n    let str = res.split(&quot;/&quot;);        // / 기준으로 배열\r\n    $(&quot;#mid&quot;).html(str[0]);\r\n    $(&quot;#name&quot;).html(str[1]);\r\n  },\r\n  error: function () { alert(&quot;전송오류!&quot;); }\r\n});</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">정리</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">기본 전송은 텍스트(문자열) — 객체는 JSON 문자열로 주고받는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서버(Java)에서는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>request.getParameter(&quot;mid&quot;)</code> 로 받는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">ajax 는 비동기 — success 안에서 결과를 사용. JSON 을 보낼 때는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>contentType: &quot;application/json&quot;</code> + <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>JSON.stringify</code></span></div></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-orange-700 font-semibold\">원본 메모의 contextType 은 contentType 의 오타이고, charset 은 $.ajax 옵션이 아니다 (contentType 에 함께 적는다).</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JavaScript › fetch · async / await, Java › 데이터 전달</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jquery/ajax/ajax-get-post","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jquery","title":"JQUERY · AJAX","path":"it/syntax/jquery"},{"id":"ajax","title":"ajax 통신","path":"it/syntax/jquery/ajax"}],"hasImage":false}